.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-new 1  "new " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-new \- Create a new email draft
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc new\fR [\fB\-\-account\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-cc\fR] [\fB\-\-bcc\fR] [\fB\-\-subject\fR] [\fB\-\-reply\fR] [\fB\-\-reply\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-forward\fR] [\fB\-\-forward\-attach\fR] [\fB\-\-attachments\fR] [\fB\-\-body\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-css\fR] [\fB\-\-template\fR] [\fB\-\-lua\-filter\fR] [\fB\-\-pandoc\-raw\fR] [\fB\-\-sign\fR] [\fB\-\-encrypt\fR] [\fB\-\-editor\fR] [\fB\-\-link\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new email draft
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-account\fR \fI<ACCOUNT>\fR
Account name (default: [defaults].account in config)
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR
Recipient(s), comma\-separated
.TP
\fB\-\-cc\fR \fI<CC>\fR
CC recipient(s), comma\-separated
.TP
\fB\-\-bcc\fR \fI<BCC>\fR
BCC recipient(s), comma\-separated
.TP
\fB\-\-subject\fR \fI<SUBJECT>\fR
Email subject line
.TP
\fB\-\-reply\fR \fI<REPLY>\fR
Message\-ID to reply to (sender only); not with \-\-to/\-\-cc
.TP
\fB\-\-reply\-all\fR \fI<REPLY_ALL>\fR
Message\-ID to reply to all recipients; \-\-to/\-\-cc override the defaults
.TP
\fB\-\-forward\fR \fI<FORWARD>\fR
Message\-ID of the message to forward (embedded as text at compile time)
.TP
\fB\-\-forward\-attach\fR \fI<FORWARD_ATTACH>\fR
Message\-ID of the message to forward as a message/rfc822 attachment
.TP
\fB\-\-attachments\fR \fI<ATTACHMENTS>\fR
Attachment file path(s)
.TP
\fB\-\-body\fR \fI<BODY>\fR
Message body (markdown)
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Body format: text (default), html, or plain
.TP
\fB\-\-css\fR \fI<CSS>\fR
CSS theme name/path/URL (html only)
.TP
\fB\-\-template\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
Pandoc template name or path
.TP
\fB\-\-lua\-filter\fR \fI<LUA_FILTER>\fR
Pandoc lua\-filter name or path. Runs after inline\-image resolution: image src is a cid: reference, not a filename
.TP
\fB\-\-pandoc\-raw\fR
Use vanilla pandoc (no template/filter/css)
.TP
\fB\-\-sign\fR
Sign the message with the account\*(Aqs signing key
.TP
\fB\-\-encrypt\fR
Encrypt the message to the recipients
.TP
\fB\-\-editor\fR
Open $EDITOR on the draft after writing
.TP
\fB\-\-link\-format\fR \fI<LINK_FORMAT>\fR
Embed link format: wikilink (![[...]]) or markdown (![](...))
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
wikilink
.IP \(bu 2
markdown
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
